name: mod-tools
description: '''
A mod provides various tools for modding.

-----------------
Version 1.7.0

## Highlight
1. Hot swap runs on a self-contained Remold agent, attached before settings load.
2. Tester completion rewritten: member completion, destructuring bindings, arrow generics; covered by JUnit 5.
3. New element editor and layout check in Review, with path copy and search filters.
4. Compiler hardened: @Switch dependency checks, SettingsLoader generation, safer javac interaction.
5. Split the hotswap_plus switch into init_fix and force_static_lambda.
6. Fixes:
	- Completion popup not showing and candidates beyond the first page being unreachable.
	- changedFx flash overflowing the scroll pane viewport.
7. Dependencies: ASM 9.11 (security advisories), Remold 0.1.2.

-----------------
WIKI: https://i-hope1.github.io/mod-tools
'''
author: "I hope..."
hidden: true
version: 1.7.0
minGameVersion: "159.2"
main: "modtools.ModTools"
repo: "I-hope1/mod-tools"